---
import Compare3Table from './compare3Table.astro';
---

<section
  id="switcher-path"
  class="compare3-block scroll-mt-24"
  aria-label="Kersivo versus marketplace booking apps"
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="compare3-block__header">
      <span class="compare3-block__badge">FOR SWITCHERS &middot; TWO MODELS</span>
      <h2>KERSIVO VS MARKETPLACE APPS.</h2>
      <p>
        Marketplace apps are proven at scale. Kersivo is built for owners who want <strong>0% Kersivo commission</strong>,
        a booking site on their own domain, and retail plus admin in one stack. Here is how the two postures differ.
      </p>
    </div>

    <Compare3Table />

    <p class="compare3-block__anchor">
      Choose breadth inside a marketplace, or margin and brand control on your own URL &mdash; both are valid; Kersivo is for the latter.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
